ilt for students in Bangladesh. Choose a skill, define your available time, and get a personal weekly action plan with progress tracking. Optional AI assistance refines your plan.</p><div><span class="pill">📚 Education</span><span class="pill">🧭 Career readiness</span><span class="pill">🇧🇩 Bangladesh-focused</span><span class="pill">🔒 Local progress saving</span></div></div><div class="card"><h2 data-i18n="start">Get started</h2><p data-i18n="startbody">Choose a skill and create a weekly learning plan. Progress stays in this browser.</p><button id="go-planner" data-i18n="create">✨ Create plan</button></div><section class="panel" id="judgeExtras" style="margin-top:14px"><h2>Try a sample learning goal</h2><p>Choose an example to get started, then tailor the plan to your time and needs.</p><div class="demo-grid"><button class="demo-btn" data-demo="Web development"><strong>01 · First website</strong>Beginner · 6 hours/week</button><button class="demo-btn" data-demo="Data analysis"><strong>02 · Data skills</strong>Beginner · 8 hours/week</button><button class="demo-btn" data-demo="AI & prompt engineering"><strong>03 · Applied AI</strong>Intermediate · 5 hours/week</button></div><div class="status-panel"><strong>AI transparency</strong><p id="aiAvailability">AI-enabled roadmap if the server API key is configured. Fallback study plans are not AI-generated. No learner input is saved to our server database.</p></div><div class="notice">This is a learning-assistance prototype, not a guarantee of jobs, admissions, or learning outcomes. Verify important recommendations independently.</div></section><div class="card"><b>YUNet AIgnite Buildathon 2026</b><p>Buildathon entry. Verify that the header artwork matches the organizer-provided official sticker before submission.</p></div></section><section class="view" id="page-roadmap"><div class="layout"><div class="panel"><h2 data-i18n="planner">Build your roadmap</h2><p class="muted">Tell us what you want to learn.</p><form id="planner"><label for="name">Your name (optional)</label><input id="name" maxlength="60" placeholder="e.g., Zakir"><label for="goal">What do you want to learn?</label><select id="goal"><option value="web">Web development</option><option value="data">Data analysis</option><option value="english">English communication</option><option value="design">UI/UX design</option><option value="ai">AI & prompt engineering</option></select><label for="level">Current level</label><select id="level"><option value="beginner">Beginner</option><option value="intermediate">Intermediate</option></select><label for="hours">Hours per week</label><input type="number" id="hours" min="2" max="40" value="6" required><label for="context">What is your biggest challenge?</label><textarea id="context" maxlength="400" placeholder="e.g., I only have my phone and 1 hour a day."></textarea><div class="buttons"><button type="submit" id="build">✨ Generate roadmap</button><button type="button" class="secondary" id="reset">Reset</button></div><p class="status" id="status" aria-live="polite"></p></form></div><div class="panel"><h2 id="resultTitle">Your personal learning journey</h2><div id="empty" class="empty">🧭<h3>A plan you can actually follow</h3><p>Generate a roadmap to see weekly milestones and track your progress.</p></div><div id="result" class="hidden"><p id="intro"></p><div class="kpi"><div class="metric"><strong id="weeks">4</strong><small>Weeks</small></div><div class="metric"><strong id="weekly">6h</strong><small>Each week</small></div><div class="metric"><strong id="pct">0%</strong><small>Completed</small></div></div><div class="progress"><div id="bar" class="bar"></div></div><div id="steps" class="steps"></div><div class="buttons"><button id="copy" class="secondary" type="button">Copy roadmap</button><button id="download" class="secondary" type="button">Download plan</button></div><p class="muted" id="method"></p></div></div></div></section><section class="view" id="page-progress"><div class="card"><h2 data-i18n="progress">◉ Progress</h2><p id="progress-summary">Create your first roadmap to start tracking weekly milestones.</p><button id="progress-open" data-i18n="roadmap">🧭 Roadmap builder</button></div></section><section class="view" id="page-about"><div class="card"><h2 data-i18n="about">ⓘ About & safety</h2><p>Shikhi AI helps students plan skill development. Roadmaps are study suggestions, not guaranteed educational or employment outcomes.</p><p>Roadmaps and checkmarks remain in this browser. AI requests send your selected goal, level, weekly hours and challenge through our server to Groq. Your name stays in this browser. Avoid sensitive personal details.</p><p>© 2026 Shikhi AI. Independent hackathon project.</p></div></section></main></div><footer class="footer"><span id="appstate">● Online-ready · Browser storage</span><span id="footSummary">0/4 milestones · No roadmap yet</span><span>© 2026 Shikhi AI</span></footer><div class="resize-handle" data-edge="n"></div><div class="resize-handle" data-edge="s"></div><div class="resize-handle" data-edge="e"></div><div class="resize-handle" data-edge="w"></div><div class="resize-handle" data-edge="ne"></div><div class="resize-handle" data-edge="nw"></div><div class="resize-handle" data-edge="se"></div><div class="resize-handle" data-edge="sw"></div></div><script>
